@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #C8141E
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FAEAEA
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #C8141E
skinparam ArrowColor #C8141E

title CAN Frame Processing — End-to-End Activity

|Source|
start
:Select source\n(Simulator · Hardware CAN · Uploaded file);

if (Source type?) then (Simulator)
  :can_simulator.py random or replay mode;
  :Publish raw frame → **raw-can-frames**\n+ session-meta → **session-meta**;
elseif (Hardware) then
  :live_can.py reads adapter\n(Vector / PEAK / Kvaser / SocketCAN);
  :Publish raw frames → **raw-can-frames**;
else (File upload)
  :User uploads via Angular UploadPage;
  :LogUploadService saves to MySQL\n+ dispatches job → **file-processing-jobs**;
  :file_worker.py consumes job;
  :Parse .blf / .asc / .txt\nvia log_parser / static_parser;
  :Publish session-meta + raw frames → **raw-can-frames**;
endif

|decoder.py|
:Consume batch from **raw-can-frames**;
:Extract msg_id from frame header;

if (msg_id found in XML catalog?) then (yes)
  :xml_decoder → decode signals\n(bit masks · byte shifts · value_maps);
  :Build decoded JSON payload\n{signals_dict, signals_flat, channel_name};
  :Publish → **decoded-signals**;
else (no)
  :Log UNKNOWN frame (warning);
  :Skip signal expansion;
  stop
endif

|Spring — CanKafkaConsumer|
:@KafkaListener consumes **decoded-signals**;
:Accumulate micro-batch\n(Reactor Sinks 60Hz);

fork
  :Write relational rows to **MySQL**\n(can_sessions · can_frames\nsignals JSON column);
fork again
  :Write time-series points to **InfluxDB**\n(ecu_measurements\ntags: session_id · signal_name);
end fork

:IntegrityAnalyzerService checks\ntiming gaps + counter errors;
:Broadcast via **WebSocket STOMP**\n/topic/live-telemetry;

fork
  |Angular Client|
  :LiveTelemetryService receives frames;
  :Update signalStateMap;
  :RAF-batched Chart.js refresh @ 60fps;
fork again
  |Unity 3D Twin|
  :CANSignalReceiver.cs (planned)\nmaps signals → animation targets\n(wheels · doors · RPM gauge);
end fork

stop
@enduml